## Key Concepts
- Telemetry schemas: per-request metrics, identifiers, and outcomes
- Privacy controls: masking in standard logs vs. audit paths
- Storage design: partitioned data lake, retention windows
- Validation: lightweight tests for latency, privacy leakage, and sampling

## Code Example
```javascript
type AuditEvent = {
  id: string;
